  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging the Positive Impact of Migration on Moldova&#x2019;s Development through Improved Policy Evidence and Better Engaged Diaspora</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the proposed Programme is to leverage the positive impact of migration on Moldova&#x2019;s socio-economic development and minimize the negative effects of migration. The goals will be achieved by strengthening the capacities of relevant public authorities for ensuring an effective country&#x2019;s migration policy design and management, and through employment of innovative instruments for better engagement of the highly skilled diaspora.</narrative>
  </description>
